seph Hamilton is an American Christian theologian, minister, author, and politician. He is senior pastor of the United Methodist Church of the Resurrection, the largest United Methodist congregation in the United States, based in the Greater Kansas City area. Hamilton is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Kansas.","extract_html":"<p><b>Adam Joseph Hamilton</b> is an American Christian theologian, minister, author, and politician. He is senior pastor of the United Methodist Church of the Resurrection, the largest United Methodist congregation in the United States, based in the Greater Kansas City area. Hamilton is the Democratic nominee in the 2026 United States Senate election in Kansas.</p>"}